# Live-trial outputs are ephemeral — regenerated by run-trial.mjs / golden-nightly.mjs.
# Only the committed fixtures/ (deterministic test data) and human-reviewed baselines/
# belong in git. Everything else (per-run <spec>/ dirs, nightly reports) is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!fixtures/
!fixtures/**
!baselines/
!baselines/**
